      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Doppler was intentionally disabled, and won't be re-enabled. It was used properly in exceedingly rare situations, and the default magnitude of the doppler effect you heard while locomoting would indicate that you were running at 60-80 MPH.\n\nMost of the time it was enabled by accident and users wouldn't know how to disable it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
