      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: For the time being, disabling Doppler completely made the most sense. The negatives of leaving it enabled far outweighed the losses of disabling it, and the video you've linked is literally the first case I've seen in VRChat where it was used intentionally and properly.\n\nAlmost every other case of Doppler usage in VRChat (while it was enabled) was an accident, and either resulted in confused users emailing our Support team, or (if the author chose to ignore the problem) a world where it was impossible to speak to others while moving.\n\nThis is one of those things we'll get back around to eventually, but it is one of many, many issues we've got queued up.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
